From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:16:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 097/113] iommu/arm-smmu-qcom: Add SM7250 MDSS

Without it the display subsystem gets a translated domain at SMMU probe,
and the scanout of the bootloader splash faults (SIDs 0xb40/0xf40) long
before the display driver takes over. Use the SM8250 ACTLR settings.

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmfiVDW3KWZdb9c3iDGRYg
---
 drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c
index 55071eb03..5d5dcece3 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c
@@ -61,6 +61,8 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_smmu_actlr_client_of_match[] = {
 			.data = (const void *) (PREFETCH_SHALLOW | CPRE | CMTLB) },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6350-mdss",
 			.data = (const void *) (PREFETCH_SHALLOW | CPRE | CMTLB) },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7250-mdss",
+			.data = (const void *) (PREFETCH_SHALLOW | CPRE | CMTLB) },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8150-mdss",
 			.data = (const void *) (PREFETCH_SHALLOW | CPRE | CMTLB) },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8250-mdss",
@@ -424,6 +426,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_smmu_client_of_match[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6115-mdss" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6350-mdss" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6375-mdss" },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7250-mdss" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8150-mdss" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8250-mdss" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8450-mdss" },
